    "Compare all selected paths from git sparse-checkout check-rules -z with the H index entries and the files on disk, including Git object IDs and modes.",
    "Run the recorded commands from each projected checkout. For Swift host and Android generated Java, also run adopt_archive.py prepare-source141 and prepare-predecessor into fresh outputs and admit each restored workflow with adopt_sdk.py or adopt_envelope.py verify --workflow-installed.",
    "Archive the selected path inventory for each product reference. Compare every blob and mode with the stage made by reversing and reapplying the v67 and v66 exact deltas using their checked-out preimages.",
    "Inventory digests hash sorted path<NUL>mode<NUL>hash<LF> rows. Git rows use Git modes and blob IDs. Disk rows use octal permissions and SHA-256 of file bytes."
